  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it to Pewter!\r",
        "We met in Oak’s lab, but here I’m a Gym\n",
        "Leader, and you’re a challenger.\r",
        "Show me what your Rock Pokémon can do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Good to see you again.\r",
        "Since Oak’s lab, I’ve wondered how your\n",
        "Normal types would do against my Rock\f",
        "types.\r",
        "Let’s find out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Well, well. The kid from Oak’s lab.\r",
        "A Water trainer, here to take the Water\n",
        "Gym’s Badge? Ha!\r",
        "Let’s see you try!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ten-hut! The Electric kid\n",
        "from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "This is my turf, soldier. Let’s see who’s\n",
        "packing more voltage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid! Told you I’d be\n",
        "watching.\r",
        "Let’s see if that armor holds up under\n",
        "fire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… Welcome. I’m so\n",
        "glad you came.\r",
        "I’ve been looking forward to seeing your\n",
        "Grass Pokémon again.\r",
        "Shall we?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …You have come, as I knew you\n",
        "would.\r",
        "I have watched you from the shadows\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now show me your Poison in the open!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! The Bug trainer from\n",
        "Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Most call Bug Pokémon weak. Show me why\n",
        "they are wrong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …I saw this battle in a vision,\n",
        "the day we met in Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Psychic trainers. Only one leaves\n",
        "with the win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said we\n",
        "would.\r",
        "Show me whether your Fairy Pokémon\n",
        "trust you as much as I foresaw."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! Quiz! Who’s the Fire trainer\n",
        "I met in Oak’s lab?\r",
        "Answer: you! Now let’s see if you can\n",
        "take the heat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_MistyIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, you’re a new face!\r",
        "Only those Trainers who have a\n",
        "policy about Pokémon can turn pro.\r",
        "What is your approach when you\n",
        "catch and train Pokémon?\r",
        "My policy is an all-out offensive\n",
        "with Water-type Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Champ in the making!\r",
        "Let me give you some advice!\r",
        "The Leader, Misty, is a pro who\n",
        "uses Water-type Pokémon.\r",
        "You can drain all their water with\n",
        "Grass-type Pokémon.\r",
        "Or, you might use Electric-type\n",
        "Pokémon and zap them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_GymAides_Text_CeruleanCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak’s Aide here!\n",
        "Misty’s pool isn’t just for show.\r",
        "Water blocks anyone who can’t Surf,\n",
        "so it steers challengers around the\f",
        "edges… right past her Swimmers.\r",
        "And nothing says Water-type Gym\n",
        "like a pool, of course!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Cerulean Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Misty\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM03",
      "en_US": [
        "TM03 teaches Water Pulse.\r",
        "Use it on an aquatic Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_WeMakePrettyGoodTeam",
      "en_US": [
        "You beat Misty!\n",
        "See, what’d I tell ya?\r",
        "You and me, kid, we make a pretty\n",
        "darn-good team!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_GymAides_Text_CeruleanCityAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "With the Cascade Badge, your Gym PC\n",
        "now sells Pool Water.\r",
        "Challengers walk around it on their\n",
        "way to your Battle Stage, so use it\f",
        "to steer them… or to make a splash!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Cerulean Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Misty\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
