      "en_US": [
        "The Cascadebadge makes all\n",
        "Pokémon up to Lv. 30 obey.\r",
        "That includes even outsiders you\n",
        "got in trades.\r",
        "There’s more. You can now use Cut\n",
        "anytime, even out of battle.\r",
        "You can Cut down small trees to\n",
        "open new pathways.\r",
        "You can also have my favorite TM."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM03FromMisty",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received TM03\n",
        "from Misty."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_GymHack_Text_MistySilverCap",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Oh, and the League makes us\n",
        "hand these out. Here!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_GymHack_Text_MistySilverCapAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "A Silver Bottle Cap maxes out one\n",
        "stat of a Pokémon.\r",
        "Don’t get a big head, though.\n",
        "A Gym Leader needs more than one\f",
        "good stat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0469_T04GYM0101_CeruleanCity_Gym_Text_BetterMakeRoomForThis",
      "en_US": "You better make room for this!"
